<title>USA: Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freddie Mac revised short-term discount note rates Friday as follows:  -	  MATURITY--RATE</p>
<p> -	 Overnight--5.05</p>
<p> -	    Feb 28--5.15</p>
<p>-    March 3,4,13--5.15  -     March 17,27--5.14</p>
<p>- May 23,27,28,30--5.13</p>
